@@ -107,9 +112,10 @@ checked by the time its other leaf can fail.
 On the Ark-0 signet (challenge
 `5121026fc5d8e79a9fbc8bc3dea07d82641d16717ce0b000c13c512d8e8c1788c6e5da51ae`) the height and the
 outputs are rules of that network, fixed in the code; there is no option to change them, and once
